    ruleType: "optional_rule",
    summary: "=Appendix 3: Magical Item Descriptions=",
    content: "=Appendix 3: Magical Item Descriptions=\n* Potions\n** Identifying Potions\n** Combining Potions\n** Potion Duration\n** Table 111: Potion Compatibility\n** List of Potions\n* Scrolls\n** Spell Level of Scroll Spells\n** Magical Spell Failure\n** Table 112: Spell Failure\n** Use of Scroll Spells\n** Casting Scroll Effects\n** Protection Scroll Effects\n** Who Can Use Scroll Spells?\n** Spell Level Range\n** Cursed Scrolls\n** Maps\n** List of Protection Scrolls\n* Rings\n** List of Rings\n* Rods\n** Command Words (Optional Rule)\n** List of Rods\n* Staves\n** Command Words (Optional Rule)\n** List of Staves\n* Wands\n** Command Words (Optional Rule)\n** List of Wands\n* Miscellaneous Magic\n** Categories of Magical Items\n** List of Magical Items\n*** List of Books, Librams, Manuals, Tomes\n*** List of Jewels, Jewelry, Phylacteries\n*** List of Cloaks and Robes\n*** List of Boots, Bracers, Gloves\n*** List of Girdles, Hats, Helms\n*** List of Bags, Bottles, Pouches, Containers\n*** List of Candles, Dusts, Ointments, Incense, and Stones\n*** List of Household Items and Tools\n*** List of Musical Instruments\n*** List of The Weird Stuff\n* Armor and Shields\n* Magical Weapons\n** Light Generation\n** Unknown or Unusual Qualities\n** List of Magical Weapons\n* Intelligent Weapons\n** Intelligent Weapon Alignment\n** Weapons Abilities\n** Weapon Ego\n** Weapons Versus Characters\n** Table 113: Weapon Intelligence and Capabilities\n** Table 114: Weapon Alignment\n** Table 115: Weapon Primary Abilities\n** Table 116: Weapon Extraordinary Powers\n** Table 117: Special Purpose Weapons\n** Table 118: Languages Spoken by Weapon\n** Table 119: Weapon Ego",
